        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a3f",
          "question": "<p>In the following question, a number series is given in which one term is wrong. Find out the wrong term.</p>\n<p>3, 7, 13, 19, 23, 37</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>13</p>",
            "<p>7</p>",
            "<p>19</p>",
            "<p>23</p>",
            "<p>37</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p>The series consists of alternate prime numbers. Hence the correct series will be:</p>\n<p>3, 7, 13, 19, 29, 37</p>\n<p>Therefore, the incorrect term is&nbsp;23.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a40",
          "question": "<p><strong>Directions : Find the wrong number in the following number series.</strong></p>\n<p>2, 6, 12, 48, 240, 1440, 10080</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>12</p>",
            "<p>6</p>",
            "<p>2</p>",
            "<p>48</p>",
            "<p>15</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explanation": "<p>Wrong number = 6</p>\n<p>2 &times; 2 = 4</p>\n<p>4 &times; 3 = 12</p>\n<p>12 &times; 4 = 48</p>\n<p>48 &times; 5 = 240</p>\n<p>240 &times; 6 = 1440</p>\n<p>1440 &times; 7 = 10080</p>\n<p>There should be 4 in place of 6.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a41",
          "question": "<p>Find the wrong number in following number series-</p>\n<p>18, 21, 23, 28, 35, 46, 59</p>",
