          "explanation": "<p>Pattern of series &ndash; Addition of consecutive prime numbers</p>\n<p>18 + 2 = 20</p>\n<p>20 + 3 = 23</p>\n<p>23 + 5 = 28</p>\n<p>28 + 7 = 35</p>\n<p>35 + 11 = 46</p>\n<p>46 + 13 = 59</p>\n<p>Wrong number = 21</p>"
        },
