        {
          "id": "6acb7c97243d5be0d55c8a44",
          "question": "<p>In the following number series, one number is given wrongly, find that number.</p>\n<p>1, 2, 5, 16, 63, 326</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>1</p>",
            "<p>5</p>",
            "<p>16</p>",
            "<p>63</p>",
            "<p>2</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p>The series followed the following format:</p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(1 \\times 1 + 1 = 2\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(2 \\times 2 + 1 = 5\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(5 \\times 3 + 1 = 16\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(16 \\times 4 + 1 = 65\\)</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(65 \\times 5 + 1 = 326\\)</span></p>\n<p>Since 65 will come in place of 63,</p>\n<p>The wrong number in the series is 63.</p>"
        },
        {
