          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Pattern:&nbsp; &nbsp;+ (odd cube) and &minus; (even square)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>5 +&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math> =32<br />32 &ndash;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math> = 16<br />16 +&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math> =<strong>141&nbsp; (140 wrong term)</strong><br />141 &ndash;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math> = 105<br />105 +&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math> = 448</p>\n<p>140 is the wrong number; the correct value in the pattern is 141.</p>"
        },
