          "explanation": "<p>&nbsp;The series follows the following pattern:</p>\n<p>&rArr; 100 - 9 = 91</p>\n<p>&rArr; 91 - 10 = 81</p>\n<p>&rArr; 81 - 11 = 70</p>\n<p>&rArr; 70 - 12 =&nbsp;<strong>58</strong></p>\n<p>&rArr; 58 -13 = 45</p>\n<p>&nbsp;The wrong term is 60</p>"
